{"name":"Debutante","hex":"#ed7468","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"debutante","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A young woman who makes her first formal appearance in society.","A female debutant, especially in sport and entertainment."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/debutante"}],"entries":[{"title":"Debutante","blocks":[{"text":"A debutante, also spelled débutante, or deb is a young woman of aristocratic or upper-class family background who has reached maturity and is presented to society at a formal \"debut\" or debutante ball. Originally, the term indicated that the woman was old enough to be married, and one purpose of her \"coming out\" was to display her to eligible bachelors and their families with a view to marriage within a select circle."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Deb%C3%BCtantinnen_Chrysanthemenball_2012.jpg/330px-Deb%C3%BCtantinnen_Chrysanthemenball_2012.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Debutante","wikidata":"Q1780030"},{"title":"Debutante (Cait Brennan album)","blocks":[{"text":"Debutante is the debut full-length album released by American singer-songwriter Cait Brennan, released on January 22, 2016. The album was independently produced and released on Brennan's own label, Black Market Glamour, and initially sold in small numbers online and through mail-order only. Debutante was a surprise critical favorite, placing highly on multiple lists of the best albums of 2016, including WFMU, Popdose, and the Village Voice Pazz & Jop poll. Its success led Brennan to an initial demo recording deal with Seymour Stein and Sire Records, followed by a long term recording deal with Omnivore Recordings, who will release Brennan's debut for the label, Third, on April 21, 2017."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/15/Cait_Brennan_-_Debutante_Cover_2016.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Debutante_(Cait_Brennan_album)","wikidata":"Q20813327"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg/500px-4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg/1280px-4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg/500px-4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Some attendees of the 2013 Vienna Opera Ball","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Young_women_making_their_debut_accompanied_by_the_younger_attendants%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1948_%284728988944%29.jpg/500px-Young_women_making_their_debut_accompanied_by_the_younger_attendants%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1948_%284728988944%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Young_women_making_their_debut_accompanied_by_the_younger_attendants%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1948_%284728988944%29.jpg/500px-Young_women_making_their_debut_accompanied_by_the_younger_attendants%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1948_%284728988944%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Young women making their debut accompanied by younger attendants in Queensland (1948)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYoung_women_making_their_debut_accompanied_by_the_younger_attendants%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1948_(4728988944).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Worth_Dress_view_2.jpg/